#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; is an application for Interactive Geometry. It's intended to serve two "
"purposes:"
msgstr ""
"&kig; je aplikacija za interaktivnu geometriju. Namjena joj je da služi za "
"dvije svrhe:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allow students to interactively explore mathematical figures and concepts "
"using the computer."
msgstr ""
"Dozvoljava studentima da interaktivno istražuju matematičke likove i "
"koncept  koristeći kompjuter."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Serve as a <acronym>WYSIWYG</acronym> tool for drawing mathematical figures "
"and including them in other documents."
msgstr ""
"Služi kao <acronym>WYSIWYG</acronym> alatka za crtanje matematičkih figura i "
"uključivanje istih u dokumente."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can report problems in &kig; using the internal bug reporting tool "
"(<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>), or just contact me at <email>toscano."
"pino@tiscali.it</email>."
msgstr ""
"Možete prijaviti probleme u &kig; koristeći internu alatku za prijavljivanje "
"grešaka (<menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prijavi grešku...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>), ili me kontaktirajte  na <email>toscano."
"pino@tiscali.it</email>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &kig; supports macros and the construction of loci, it allows for some "
"rather advanced macros to be defined. If you have created an interesting "
"macro, which you think might be useful for other people, please mail it to "
"me at <email>toscano.pino@tiscali.it</email>, so I can include it in the "
"distribution (if you do this, it will be licensed under the terms of &kig;'s "
"license, the <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html#GPL"
"\">GPL</ulink>, so that other people can freely use and adapt it)."
msgstr ""
"S obzirom da &kig; podržava makroe i konstrukciju loci-a, tim omogućava "
"naprednijim makroima da budu definirani. U slučaju da ste kreirali "
"interesantan makro, za koji mislite da bi mogao biti od pomoći drugim "
"ljudima, molim vas pošaljite mi na <email>toscano.pino@tiscali.it</email>, "
"da ga mogu uključiti u distribuciju ( ako to uradite, bit će licenciran "
"uslovima &kig;'s licence,<ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses."
"html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, da ga drugi ljudi mogu slobodno koristiti i "
"adaptirati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic usage"
msgstr "Osnovna upotreba"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constructing Objects"
msgstr "Pravljenje Objekata"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constructing points"
msgstr "Pravljenje tačaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can construct points in several ways:"
msgstr "Možete praviti tačku na nekoliko načina:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Points</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Point</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar "
"or press the appropriate button in the toolbar. You can then construct a "
"point by clicking at the desired position in the window."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Tačke</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tačka</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz menija ili "
"pritisnite odgovarajuću tipku na traci za alatke. Možete kontruisati tačku "
"ako kliknete na odgovarajuću poziciju u prozoru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the &Shift; key to activate a snap raster mode which allows you to set "
"any point in a construction exactly to points of the grid."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite &Shift; tipku da aktivirate snap raster način koji vam dozvoljava "
"da postavite bilo koju tačku u konstrukciji preko koordinata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actually, this works the same way for constructing other objects as well: "
"click on the desired menubar entry or toolbar button and select the "
"necessary items to construct the object."
msgstr ""
"Ustvari, ovo radi po istom principu za pravljenje drugih objekata također: "
"kliknite na željeni menubar unos ili toolbar tipku i odaberite potrebne "
"stavke za izgradnju objekta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since you often need to construct points, simply clicking somewhere in the "
"screen with the &MMB; will construct a point for you, without going to a "
"menu or button."
msgstr ""
"S obzirom da često morate praviti tačke, jednostavno klikom negdje na ekran "
"sa &MMB; napravit će tačku, bez korištenja menija ili tipke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can construct points while you are building other objects in the "
"background, optionally selecting them for the object you are building. For "
"more on this, see <xref linkend=\"constructing-other-objects\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Možete praviti tačke dok pravite druge objekte u pozadini, opcionalno ih "
"odabiru za objekt koji se gradi. Za više o ovome, pogledajte <xref linkend="
"\"constructing-other-objects\"/>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A point has been constructed</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Tačka je napravljena</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A point has been constructed</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Tačka je napravljenja</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constructing Other Objects"
msgstr "Pravljenje drugih objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Constructing objects other than points is usually done by selecting the "
"appropriate entry in the <guimenu>Objects</guimenu> menu, or by clicking on "
"one of the toolbar buttons."
msgstr ""
"Pravljenje objekata koje nisu tačke je obično urađeno selektiranjem "
"odgovarajućih unosa u <guimenu>Objects</guimenu> meniju, ili klikom na jednu "
"od tipki alatne trake."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Constructing a circle</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pravljenje kruga</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:175 index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Constructing a circle</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pravljenje kruga</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will start the construction of the chosen object type. All of these "
"types require arguments. For example, if you selected to construct a circle "
"by center and point, you will need to give two points: one for the center, "
"and one for the point on the circle."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će pokrenuti izgradnju odabranog objekta. Za sve ovo tipove su neophodni "
"argumenti, Na primjer, ako ste seliektirali da konstruišete krug pored "
"centra i tačke trebat ćete dati 2 tačke: jednu za centar, i jednu sa kruga."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These arguments are objects too, which can also be selected, simply by "
"clicking on them. When you move the cursor over an argument you want to use "
"to construct an object, a preliminary image will be shown of the object, so "
"you will know what it will look like. For objects that require points as "
"arguments, you can place a new point at the current cursor position and "
"select it by clicking the &LMB;."
msgstr ""
"Ovi argumenti su također objekti, koji se mogu selektirati, jednostavnim "
"klikom na njih. Kada pomjerite kursor preko argumenta željet ćete ga "
"koristiti da konstruišete objekat, preliminarna slika objekta će biti "
"prikazana, da bi znali kako će izgledati. Za objekte koji zahtjevaju tačke "
"kao argumente, možete postaviti novu tačku na trenutnu poziciju kursora i "
"selektirati klikom na &LMB;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can always cancel the construction of the new object by pressing the "
"&Esc; button or by clicking on the <guiicon>Cancel Construction</guiicon> "
"button (red octagon with an <quote>X</quote>) on the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Uvijek možete obustaviti konstrukciju novog objekta klikom na &Esc; tipku "
"ili klikom na <guiicon>Cancel Construction</guiicon> tipka (crveni kavez sa "
"<quote>X</quote>) na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constructing a circle."
msgstr "Konstrukcija kruga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Objects"
msgstr "Selektiranje objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting objects can be done in two ways:"
msgstr "Selektiranje objekata možete uraditi na dva načina:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply clicking on an object causes that object to be selected, clearing the "
"current selection. If you want to select multiple objects simultaneously, "
"hold down the &Ctrl; key while clicking on an object."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavnim klikom na objekat selektira ga, brišući trenutnu selekciju. Ako "
"želite selektirati vise objekata simultano, čuvati &Ctrl; tipku i kliknuti "
"na objekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking and dragging on an empty spot on the screen, you can select all "
"objects within the rectangle that is created. This action will clear the "
"current selection. As in the previous case, holding down the &Ctrl; key "
"allows you to keep the current selection."
msgstr ""
"Klikom i pomjeranjem prazne tačke na ekranu, možete selektirati sve objekte "
"oko pravougaonika koji se stvara. Ova akcija će obrisati trenutni izbor. Kao "
"i u prethodnom slučaju, držeći &Ctrl; tipku vam omogućava da zadržite "
"trenutni izbor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have more than one object under the mouse (indicated by "
"<guilabel>Which object?</guilabel> in the statusbar and at the mouse "
"cursor), you can easily choose which object select or add to the current "
"selection. Click with the &LMB;, while holding the &Shift; key or click the "
"&RMB;, to have a popup with all the objects under the mouse. Then, you can "
"select the object you need. As said before, the behaviour of the &Ctrl; key "
"will affect the selection."
msgstr ""
"Kada imate više od jednog objekta ispod miša (označen <guilabel> Koji "
"objekat? </guilabel> u statusbaru i na kursoru miša), možete lako odabrati "
"koji objekt selektirati ili dodati na trenutni izbor. Kliknom na &LMB;, dok "
"držite &Shift; tipku ili kliknite na &RMB;, imati popup sa svim objektima "
"pod miša. Zatim, možete odabrati koji objekt trebate. Kao što je ranije "
"rečeno, ponašanje &Ctrl; tipke će uticati na odabir."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Selecting objects</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Selektiranje objekata</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Selecting objects</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Selektiranje objekata</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving Objects"
msgstr "Pomjeranje Objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move objects, you must first <link linkend=\"selecting-objects\">select</"
"link> them."
msgstr ""
"Da bi pomjerili objekat, prvo ih morate <link linkend=\"selecting-objects"
"\">select</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the objects you want to move are selected, you can start moving them by "
"&LMB; clicking and dragging any one of them. When you are done, simply "
"release the &LMB;."
msgstr ""
"Kada su selektirani objekti koje želite pomjeriti, možete ih pomjeriti &LMB; "
"klikom i povlačiti bilo koji od njih. Kada završite, jednostavno pustite "
"&LMB;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For some types of objects (especially when defined by complicated loci), "
"moving them can be slow on old hardware. This is unfortunate, but "
"inevitable, given the calculations involved."
msgstr ""
"Za neke tipove objekata ( posebno ako su definirane komplikovanim loci-"
"em ) , njihovo pomjeranje može biti sporo na starom hardveru. To je žalosno, "
"ali neizbježno, s obzirom na uključene kalkulacije,."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you &RMB; click one of the selected objects, and choose "
"<guimenuitem>Move</guimenuitem>, moving the mouse will move the object. When "
"the object is moved to the desired position, another &LMB; click will stop "
"the moving of the object."
msgstr ""
"Ako &RMB; Kliknete na jedan od odabranih objekata, i odaberete <guimenuitem> "
"Pomjeri </guimenuitem>, pomicanjem miša će se kretati objekt. Kada je objekt "
"pomjeren na željenu poziciju, još jedan &LMB; klik će zaustaviti kretanje "
"objekta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting objects"
msgstr "Brisanje objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Deleting objects is done by first <link linkend=\"selecting-objects"
"\">selecting</link> them, and next doing either of these:"
msgstr ""
"Brisanje objekata se vrši tako što se prvo <link linkend=\"selecting-objects"
"\">selektiraju</link>, uz bilo koji od ovih:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Press the <keycap>Delete</keycap> key."
msgstr "Pritisni <keycap>Obriši</keycap> tipku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Press the <guiicon>Delete Objects</guiicon> button on the toolbar."
msgstr "Pritisnite dugme <guiicon> Obriši Objekte </guiicon> na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton>-click on one of the objects, and select "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> in the <link linkend=\"objects-context-"
"menus\">context menu</link> that appears."
msgstr ""
"<mousebutton> Desnim </mousebutton> -Klikom na jedan od objekata, i "
"odaberite <guimenuitem> Obriši </guimenuitem> u <link linkend=\"objects-"
"context-menus\">kontekstnom meniju</link> koji se pojavljuje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Showing and hiding objects"
msgstr "Prikazivanje i skrivanje objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kig;, objects can be hidden. This is done by selecting the objects, "
"&RMB; clicking one of them, and selecting <guimenuitem>Hide</guimenuitem> in "
"the <link linkend=\"objects-context-menus\">context menu</link> that appears."
msgstr ""
"u &kig;, objekti mogu biti skriveni.  Ovo se napravi selektiranjem objekata, "
"&RMB; klikom na jedan od njih, i selektiranjem <guimenuitem>Sakrij</"
"guimenuitem> u <link linkend=\"objects-context-menus\">kontekstni meni</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To unhide the objects, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Unhide All</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This will unhide "
"all currently hidden objects."
msgstr ""
"Da biste otkrili objekte, koristite <menuchoice> <guimenu> Izmijeni </"
"guimenu><guimenuitem> Otkrij Sve </guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Ovo će "
"otkrili sve trenutno skrivene objekte."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Night Vision"
msgstr "Noćni pogled"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Night Vision is a particular way of working with hidden objects. When you "
"have to move or change something in one or more object but without unhiding "
"all the hidden objects you have, then the night vision mode will be of "
"benefit to you."
msgstr ""
"Noćni pogled je poseban način rada sa skrivenim objektima. Kada morate "
"pomjeriti ili nešto promijeniti u jednom ili više objekata, ali bez "
"otkrivanja svih skrivenih predmete koje imate, onda će režim noćni pogled "
"biti od koristi za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Basically, it allows you to see the hidden objects as if they were visible, "
"so that you can manipulate them as you would normally. In Night Vision mode, "
"the hidden objects will be visible with a grey colour."
msgstr ""
"U osnovi, to vam omogućuje da vidite skrivene predmete kao da su vidljivi, "
"tako da ih možete manipulirati kao što bi inače. U Noćni pogled modu, "
"skriveni objekti će biti vidljivi sivom bojom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To toggle the night vision mode, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Wear Infrared Glasses</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Za uključivanje režima noćni pogled, koristite <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem> Nosite Infrared naočale </"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "Poništiti/Obnoviti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kig;, you can undo almost any change you make in the document. Just use "
"the <guiicon>Undo</guiicon>/<guiicon>Redo</guiicon> buttons on the toolbar, "
"the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu or the appropriate shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"U &KIG;, možete poništiti gotovo svaku promjenu koju napravite u dokumentu. "
"Dovoljno je koristiti <guiicon> Undo </guiicon>/<guiicon>Vrati</guiicon> "
"dugmad na alatnoj traci, na <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu> meni ili "
"odgovarajuće prečice."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full Screen Mode"
msgstr "Režim punog ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; also has a Full Screen mode. To use it, click the appropriate button "
"on the toolbar, or select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Full Screen Mode</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&kig; također ima režim punog ekrana. Da biste ga koristili, kliknite na "
"odgovarajući gumb na alatnoj traci ili odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Režim punog ekrana</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To leave Full Screen mode, &RMB; click the screen at a place where there is "
"no object present, and select <guimenuitem>Exit Full Screen Mode</"
"guimenuitem>, or press the shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;"
"<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi ostavili režim punog ekrana, ii &RMB; klikom na ekranu na mjestu "
"gdje nema prisutnog objekta, i odaberite <guimenuitem> Izađi iz režima punog "
"ekrana</guimenuitem> ili pritisnite prečicu <keycombo action = \"simul\"> "
"&Ctrl;&Shift; <keycap>F</keycap > </keycombo>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; Object Types"
msgstr "&kig; Vrste objekata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; supports a rather large number of object types. Please note that not "
"all of the available object types are shown in the toolbars: there are some "
"objects that you can only construct via the <guimenu>Objects</guimenu> menu "
"in the menu bar. Of course, as with all &kde; applications, the contents of "
"the toolbars are configurable. Try out the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option "
"if you want to do this."
msgstr ""
"&kig; podržava prilično veliki broj vrsta objekata. Imajte na umu da nisu "
"sve raspoložive vrste objekata prikazani u alatnim trakama: postoje neki "
"objekti koje možete izgraditi samo preko <guimenu> Objekti </guimenu>u traci "
"izbornika. Naravno, kao i kod svih &kde; aplikacije, sadržaj alatne trake su "
"podesive. Isprobajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši alatnu traku ... </guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ako želite da to uradite."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Usage"
msgstr "Napredno korištenje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "Context Menus"
msgstr "Kontekstni Meni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; has context menus for its objects. Try &RMB; clicking on an object in "
"order to see a context menu appear. There are many options: for constructing "
"other objects, setting colours, pen width, style, and even hiding, moving or "
"deleting objects. Some objects have options of their own (&eg; you can "
"redefine certain points to be constrained to a line if they previously "
"weren't, &etc;). These options should be very straightforward to understand."
msgstr ""
"&kig; ima kontekstne menije za svoje objekte. Pokušajte &RMB; klikom na "
"predmet da bi se kontekstni meni pojavio. Postoje mnoge opcije: za izgradnju "
"drugih objekata, postavljanje boje, širina olovke, stil, pa čak i "
"sakrivanje, pomjeranje ili brisanje objekata. Neki objekti imaju posebne "
"mogućnosti (&eg; možete redefinisati određene tačke da se ograniče na liniju "
"ako prethodno nisu bili, &etc;). Ove opcije bi trebao biti vrlo jednostavan "
"za razumjeti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some of the actions in the context menu of an object need another defined "
"object as reference, for example:"
msgstr ""
"Neke akcije u kontekstnom meniju o objektu će trebati određeni objekt za "
"referencu, na primjer:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rotate a shape a specific number of degrees around a point"
msgstr "Rotiraj oblik određeni broj stepeni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Angles</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Angle by Three Points</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"and make your desired angle of rotation somewhere in the &kig; window, "
"generally in an unobtrusive place. If desired, right click on the angle and "
"click on <menuchoice><guimenu>Add Text Label</guimenu><guimenuitem>Angle in "
"Degrees</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu><guisubmenu>Uglovi</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Ugao za tri tačke</guimenuitem></menuchoice> i "
"učiniti vaš  željeni ugao rotacije negdje u &KIG; prozor, uglavnom u "
"nenametljivo mjesto. Ako želite, desni klik na ugao i kliknite na "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu> Dodaj oznaku za tekst </guimenu><guimenuitem> ugao u "
"stepenima </guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click with the &RMB; on the angle and select <guimenuitem>Set Size</"
"guimenuitem> and insert the new size for this angle in the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite sa &RMB; na ugao i odaberite <guimenuitem> Postavi Veličinu </"
"guimenuitem> i umetnite novu veličinu za ovaj ugao u dijalogu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:425 index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on <guimenu>Objects</guimenu> and construct your desired object."
msgstr "Kliknite na <guimenu>Objekti</guimenu> i konstruišite željeni objekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Right click on your shape, and select on <menuchoice><guimenu> Transform</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Rotate</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik na oblik i izaberite na <menuchoice> <guimenu> Transformiraj </"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Rotiraj</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set your desired point of rotation."
msgstr "Postavi željenu tačku rotacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on your angle."
msgstr "Klikni na ugao."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your shape is rotated!"
msgstr "Vaš oblik je rotiran!"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translate an object"
msgstr "Prevedi objekat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Vectors &amp; "
"Segments</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Vector</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> and "
"construct the object by selecting the start and end point somewhere in the "
"&kig; window."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu><guisubmenu> vektori &amp; "
"Segmenti</guisubmenu><guimenuitem> Vektor </guimenuitem> </menuchoice> i "
"izgradnju objekta odabirom prve i zadnje tačke negdje u &KIG; prozoru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To adjust length and direction of the vector you have to edit its start and "
"end point. Select them and choose in the context menu <guimenuitem>Set "
"Coordinate...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"Za podešavanje dužine i smjera vektora  morate izmijeniti njenu početnu i "
"zadnju tačku. Selektirajte ih i odaberite ih u kontekst meniju <guimenuitem> "
"Postavi koordinatu ... </guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Right click on your object, and select on <menuchoice><guimenu>Transform</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Translate</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik na objekat, i odaberi na <menuchoice><guimenu>Transformiraj</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prevedi</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the vector to translate by."
msgstr "Odaberi vektor po kojem ćete prevesti,."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document context menus"
msgstr "Dokumentuj kontekst meni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton>-clicking on the document (&ie; not on an "
"object) will present a popup that you can use to start constructing a new "
"object, change the coordinate system used, show hidden objects, zoom in and "
"zoom out of the document and switch to the full screen mode."
msgstr ""
"<mousebutton>Right</mousebutton> klikom na dokument (&ie; ne na objekat) "
"pojavit će se popup kojeg možete početi koristiti za konstruisanje novog "
"objekta, promjeniti koordinate korištenog sistema, prikazati skrivene "
"objekte, uvećati i umanjiti dokument i promijeniti na režim punog ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defining Macros"
msgstr "Definiranje Makroa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the more advanced features in &kig; is its support for macros. This "
"allows you to define new types of objects from other ones which are defined "
"already."
msgstr ""
"Jedna od naprednijih osobina u &kig; je podrška za makro instrukcijee. To "
"vam omogućava da definirate novi tip objekata od onih koji su već prethodno "
"definirani."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example: Suppose you want to make a macro for constructing a circle from "
"three points on it. You would input three points, then construct some "
"perpendiculars and midpoints until you find the center. Now you can use the "
"existing <guimenuitem>Circle by Center &amp; Point</guimenuitem> command "
"(using one of the three points as the point for this command). The following "
"image should make this a bit more clear:"
msgstr ""
"Na primjer: Pretpostavimo da želite napraviti makro za izgradnju kruga od "
"tri tačke na njemu. Unijeli bi tri tačke, a zatim izgradili neke normale i "
"središta dok ne pronađete centar. Sada možete koristiti postojeće "
"<guimenuitem> Krug preko centra &amp; Point </guimenuitem> komandu "
"(koristeći jednu od tri tačke kao osnovu za ovu naredbu). Sljedeće slike bi "
"to trebalo malo jasnije:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Test running macros</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Makroi koji se testiraju</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Test running macros</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Makroi koji se testiraju</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next comes defining the macro. Select <guimenuitem>New Macro...</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Types</guimenu> menu, or click on the button "
"on the toolbar. A wizard will appear and ask you to select the given "
"objects. In our example, these are the three points. Select the three points "
"(click on them to select, click again to unselect) and click the "
"<guibutton>Next</guibutton> button to continue. Finally, select the last "
"objects (only the circle in our example)."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće dolazi definiranje makroa. Selektiranjem <guimenuitem>Novi Makro..."
"</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Tipovi</guimenu> menija, ili klikom na gumb na "
"alatnoj traci. Čarobnjak će se pojaviti i reći vam da selektujete objekte. U "
"našem primjeru, to su tri tačke. Selektuj tri tačke (klikni na njih da bi ih "
"selektovao, klikni opet da bi ih deselektovao) i klikni na <guibutton>Idući</"
"guibutton> gumb da bi nastavio. Na kraju, selektiraj zadnji objekat ( samo "
"krug u našem slučaju)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The macro wizard</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Makro čarobnjak</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The macro wizard</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Makro čarobnjak</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the previous steps are completed, click the <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton> button to continue. Enter a name and optionally a description for "
"your new type, and click the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button. Your "
"macro type is now finished."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je zadnji korak završen, kliknite na <guibutton>Idući</guibutton> "
"gumb da bi nastavili. Upiši ime i opcionalno opiši svoj novi tip, i klikni "
"na <guibutton>Završi</guibutton> gumb. Vaš makro tip je završen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use the new macro type, click its button on the toolbar or use the "
"<guimenu>Objects</guimenu> menu. Constructing a macro object is just like "
"constructing any other object."
msgstr ""
"Za korištenje novog makro tipa, klikni njen gumb na alatnoj traci  ili "
"upotrijebi <guimenu>Objekti</guimenu> meni. Konstruisanje makro objekta je "
"isto kao konstruisanje bilo kojeg objekta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Using your new type</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Korištenje vašeg novog tipa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Using your new type</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Korištenje vašeg novog tipa</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with types"
msgstr "Rad sa tipovima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you saw in the previous chapter, &kig; allows you to create your own "
"objects. &kig; also makes sure that once you have created an object, it is "
"saved on exit and loaded on startup. You do not have to manually save or "
"load macro definitions. However, &kig; does allow you to do more with the "
"macros. If you select <menuchoice><guimenu>Types</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Manage Types...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menu, you will see a dialog where you can edit your types. It allows you to "
"modify the existant types, delete types that are no longer used, export them "
"to a file, or even load them from another file."
msgstr ""
"Kao što ste vidjeli u prošlom poglavlju, &kig;  vam dozvoljava da kreirate "
"vlastite objekte. &kig; isto tako garantuje da kada jednom kreirate objekat, "
"on je sačuvan na izlazu i pokrenut na ulazu u isti. Ne morate ručno sačuvati "
"ili pokrenuti makro definicije. Mada, &kig; vam ne dozvoljava da uradite "
"više sa makroima. Ako selektujete t <menuchoice><guimenu>Tipovi</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Upravljanje tipovima...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz "
"menia, pokazat če vam dijalog gdje možete izmjeniti vaše tipove. Dozvoljava "
"vam da modifikujete postojeće tipove, izbrišete one koji se više ne koriste, "
"izvesti ih u folder, ili ih čak pokrenuti iz nekog drugog foldera."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit Types Dialog"
msgstr "Urediti Tipove Dijaloga"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit Types Dialog"
msgstr "Uređujući tipovi dijaloga"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text labels"
msgstr "Tekst oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; allows you to add text labels to a construction. This is very useful "
"for adding names, explanations or other text to constructions. &kig; can "
"also display variable information about objects (also known as "
"<quote>properties</quote>)."
msgstr ""
"&kig; dozvoljava vam da dodate tekst oznake konstruisanju. To je veoma "
"koristan za dodavanje imena, objašnjenja ili drugi tekst za konstruisanje. "
"&kig; također može prikazati promjenjive informacije o objektima (također "
"poznat kao <quote>properties</quote> )."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start constructing a text label, simply press the <guibutton>Text Label</"
"guibutton> button in the &kig; toolbar or select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu><guisubmenu>Other </"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Text Label</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> in the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da počnete konstruisati tekst oznaku, jednostavno pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Tekst  Oznaka</guibutton> gumb u &kig; alatnoj traci ili "
"selektiraj <menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu><guisubmenu>Drugo</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tekst Oznaka</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> u menibaru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:598
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, you have to choose a location for the text label. You can either just "
"select a random location on the screen, or choose to <quote>attach</quote> "
"the label to an object."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće, trebate izabrati lokaciju za sljedeću tekst oznaku. Možete ili "
"selektirati slučajnu lokaciju na ekranu, ili izabrati <quote>attach</quote> "
"da označite objekat."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:604
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Attaching a label to a circle...</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pričvrščivanje oznake na krug...</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Attaching a label to a circle...</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pričvrščivanje oznake na krug...</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have selected where to put the label, the text label dialog "
"appears. Here, you can type in the text that you want in the new label, and "
"click <guibutton>Finish</guibutton>. You should now see the label in your "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što sektirate gdje staviti oznaku,  oznaka dijaloga se pojavljuje. Tu "
"možete tipkati tekst koji želite u novoj oznaki, i kliknuti  "
"<guibutton>FKraj</guibutton>. Tada bi ste trebali vidjeti oznaku na vašem "
"dokumentu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Text Label Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dijalog za oznaku teksta</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Text Label Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog za oznaku teksta</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:631
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The previous example was a simple one, and limited to just text. However, "
"there is also support for showing variable information about objects in a "
"label (&eg; you can construct a label with the text <quote>This segment is "
"%1 units long.</quote> where <token>%1</token> would be dynamically replaced "
"with the length of a specific segment)."
msgstr ""
"Prethodni primjer je bio jednostavan, i limitiran samo na tekst. Međutim, tu "
"je i podrška za prikaz različitih informacije o objektima u oznakama (&eg; "
"možete konstruisati oznaku sa tekstom <quote> Ovaj segment je dug %1 "
"jedinica. </quote> gdje <token>%1</token> bi dinamički bio zamijenjen sa "
"dužinom određenog segmenta)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To do this, enter a text with a number of placeholders ( <token>%1</token>, "
"<token>%2</token> &etc;) in it. Then, press the <guibutton>Next</guibutton> "
"button to continue. If you want to change the text or variables later, you "
"can go back using the <guibutton>Back</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Da bi uradili ovo, unesite text sa brojem držača mjesta ( <token>%1</token>,"
"<token>%2</token> &etc;) u njemu. Zatim, pritisnite <guibutton>Idući</"
"guibutton> gumb da nastavite. Ako želite da promijenite tekst ili varijable "
"poslije, možete ići unatrag koristeći <guibutton>Nazadk</guibutton> gumb."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:646
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The wizard now shows the text you entered with all placeholders replaced by "
"something like <guilabel>argument 1</guilabel>. Selecting the property "
"connected to a certain argument is done by first clicking on the argument in "
"question. Then click on the object that you need and that has this property, "
"and then select the property itself in the popup menu that appears. For "
"instance, in the example above, you would click <guilabel>argument 1</"
"guilabel>, click on the correct segment in the main &kig; window, and select "
"the property <guilabel>Length</guilabel>. Afterwards, you can fill in the "
"rest of the variable parts, or select another property for one of the "
"variable parts if you wish to change it. When you are ready, click the "
"<guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button to complete the construction of the "
"text label."
msgstr ""
"Čarobnjak sada pokazuje tekst koji ste unijeli sa svim držačima mjesta "
"zamijenjenih sa nečim kao <guilabel>argument 1</guilabel>.  Selektiranjem  "
"osobine povezane sa određenim argumentom je urađeno tako što se prvo klikne "
"na argument u pitanju. Nakon toga klikom na objekt koji trebate i koji ima "
"tu osobinu, i onda selektujte osobinu u popup meniju koji se pojavi. Na "
"primjer, možete ispuniti ostatak varijabilne dijelove, ili selektirati neku "
"drugu osobinu za dio varijable koju želite promijeniti. Kada ste spremni, "
"kliknite <guibutton>Završi</guibutton> gumb da završite konstruisanje oznake "
"teksta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:664
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Selecting a property for a variable part</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Selektujte osobinu za dio varijable</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Selecting a property for a variable part</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Selektiranje osobine za dio varijable</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loci"
msgstr "Loci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; supports the use of loci. A locus is mathematically defined as the set "
"of all points or lines that satisfy or are determined by specific "
"conditions; as in <quote>the locus of points equidistant from a given point "
"is a circle</quote>. Let's look at an example of how to use loci in &kig;:"
msgstr ""
"&kig; podržava korištenje loci-a. Lokus je matematički definiran kao skup "
"svih tačaka ili linija koje zadovoljavaju ili su determinisane specifičnim "
"uslovima; kao u <quote>lokus tačaka na jednakom odstojanju od date tačke je "
"krug</quote>. Pogledajmo primjer kako koristiti loci u &kig;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Consider the following geometrical construction: We draw a circle, and a "
"point that can move only along its circumference (construct this point by "
"positioning the cursor on a circle, and clicking the &MMB;. If you then try "
"to move the resulting point, you'll see that you cannot move it off the "
"circle). Then, we draw a segment from that point to the center of the "
"circle, and the midpoint of that segment."
msgstr ""
"Razmotrite sljedeće geometrijske konstrukcije: Mi crtamo krug, i tačku koja "
"se može kretati samo uz svoje granice ( konstruiši ovu tačku pozicioniranjem "
"kursora na drug, i klikom na &MMB;. Ako tada pokušate pomjeriti "
"rezultirajuću tačku, vidjet ćete da je ne možete pomjeriti sa kruga). Tada, "
"nacrtamo segment od te tačke prema centru kruga, i centralnu tačku tog "
"segmenta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A simple construction using a locus</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Jednostavna konstrukcija upotrebom lokusa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A simple construction using a locus</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Jednostavna konstrukcija upotrebom lokusa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now if you move the point that is constrained to the circle, you'll see that "
"the second point moves along with it. If you were to hold a pen at the "
"second point, and move the first point around the entire circle, a new "
"circle, half the size of the other would be drawn. The path that the second "
"point travels while the first one moves around the circle is its locus."
msgstr ""
"Sada, ako pomjerite tačku koja je ograničena krugom, vidjet ćete da se "
"sljedeća tačka promjera shodno njome. Ako bi ste  držali olovku na drugoj "
"tačci i pomjerili je sa prve tačke oko čitavog kruga, novi krug, pola te "
"veličine će biti nacrtano. Put kojim druga tačka  putuje dok se prva tačka "
"kreće oko kruga je njen lokus."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actually constructing the locus of a point is very easy. Click the "
"<guiicon>locus</guiicon> button in the toolbar, or select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Other</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Locus</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the menubar. Then select "
"the constrained point as the moving point (the text <guilabel>Moving Point</"
"guilabel> will appear as you move the mouse over it), and the other as the "
"dependent point. The locus of the dependent point will then be drawn."
msgstr ""
"Ustvari konstruisanje lokusa tačke je veoma jednostavno. Klikni "
"<guiicon>lokus</guiicon> gumb u alatnoj traci, ili selektujte "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Drugi</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Lokus</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> iz meni bara. Tada selektujte "
"ograničenu tačku kao pokretnu tačku ( tekst <guilabel>Pomjerajuća tačka</"
"guilabel> će se pojaviti kako budete pomjerali miš preko njega), i drugi kao "
"zavisna tačka. Lokus zavisne tačke će tada biti nacrtan."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Skripte"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; allows you to create custom types in the Python scripting language. "
"This is a very advanced feature, and I know of only one other Interactive "
"Geometry program that has a similar functionality (the <acronym>GNOME</"
"acronym> program &drgeo;)."
msgstr ""
"&kig;  vam dozvoljava da kreirate modifikovane tipove u Python scripting "
"jeziku. Ovo je veoma napredna odlika, i znam za samo jedan   Interactive "
"Geometry program koji ima sličnu funkcionalnost (<acronym>GNOME</acronym> "
"program &drgeo;)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Python Scripting in &kig; basically allows you to create your own objects "
"from certain parent objects. For example, if you are a math teacher, and you "
"have some fancy way of calculating an interesting point on a conic, then "
"instead of messing with complex constructions and macros, you could just "
"write down in Python code how the point is to be calculated and then &kig; "
"will show it for you."
msgstr ""
"Phyton Scripting u &kig; omogučava vam da kreirate vlastite objekte sa "
"određenog porijeklaobjekta. Na primjer, ako ste učitelj matematike, i imate "
"neki izvrstan način računanja interesantne tačke na konisu, onda umjesto "
"bavljenja sa kompleksnim konstrukcijama i makroima, trebali bi samo napisati "
"Phython kod kako tačka treba biti izračunata i onda &kig; će pokazati za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Suppose you were not aware of the &kig; built-in type <quote>Mid Point</"
"quote>, and you wanted to show the midpoint of two given points. You would "
"then click on the <guibutton>Python Script</guibutton> button in the "
"toolbar, or select <menuchoice><guimenu>Objects</guimenu><guisubmenu>Other</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Python Script</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar. You are then presented with a wizard that allows you to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Predpostavite da niste bili svjesni &kig; tipa <quote>Među tačka</quote>, i "
"htjeli ste pokazati među tačku dvije date tačke. Onda bi kliknuli na "
"<guibutton>Phython Skripta</guibutton> gumb u alatnoj traci, ili selektuj "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Objekti</guimenu><guisubmenu>Drugi</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Phython Skripta</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz menibara. Tada "
"vam je predstavljen čarobnjak koji vam dozvoljava da nastavite."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Script Object Wizard</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Skripta Predmeta Čarobnjaka</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Script Object Wizard</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Skripta Predmeta Čarobnjaka</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:771
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first thing you have to do is select the arguments for the script "
"object. In our example, this means the two points of which we want to show "
"the midpoint. Select them in the &kig; main window, and click "
"<guibutton>Next</guibutton> to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Prva stvar koju treba da uradite je da seletujete argumente iz skripte "
"objekta. U našem primjeru, ovo se odnosi na dvije tačke koje želimo da "
"prikažemo na međutački. Selektujte ih u &kig; glavnom prozoru. i kliknite "
"<guibutton>Idući</guibutton> da nastavite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you are presented with a text edit box where you can enter the code for "
"you script object. Template code and some comments are already in place. It "
"is important to make sure that your code is valid Python code. People "
"familiar with Python will notice that we are actually defining a Python "
"function called <function>calc</function>. It is therefore necessary to "
"adhere to the Python rules for defining functions. For example, every line "
"of the function should start with a &Tab;. The first line not starting with "
"a &Tab; ends the definition of the function."
msgstr ""
"Sada vam je prikazan kutija za izmjenu teksta gdje možete unijeti kod za vaš "
"skript objekt. Šablon kod i drugi komentari su već na mjestu. Važno je da "
"osigurate da je vaš kod validan Phython kod. Ljudi upoznati sa Phython će "
"primjetiti da mi ustvari definiramo Phython funkciju koja se zove "
"<function>calc</function>. Zbog toga je neophodno da se doda u Phython "
"pravila za definiranje funkcija. Na primjer, svaka linija funkcije bi "
"trebala početi sa &Tab;. Prva linija koja ne počinje sa &Tab; završava sa "
"definicijom funkcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Python function that we want to define is called <function>calc</"
"function>, and in our case it accepts two arguments. These are the objects "
"you have selected as arguments in the previous screen. You need as many "
"arguments as you have selected there. They are called <parameter>arg1</"
"parameter> and <parameter>arg2</parameter>, but you can change their names "
"to something more meaningful if you want."
msgstr ""
"Phython funkcija koju želimo definisati zovemo <function>calc</function>, i "
"u našem slučaju prihvata dva argumenta. To su objekti koje ste selektirati "
"kao argumente sa predhodnog ekrana. Trebate što više argumenata moguće kao "
"što ste tamo selektirali. Oni se zovu <parameter>arg1</parameter> and "
"<parameter>arg2</parameter>, ali im možete promijeniti imena u nešto "
"smislenije ako želite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the function, you can do all sorts of calculations that you deem "
"necessary, using the two arguments if needed. You should return the object "
"you want to define. In our case, this is a <classname>Point</classname> "
"object. The two arguments are also <classname>Point</classname> objects, and "
"we can use the <function>Point.coordinate()</function> function to define "
"the coordinates of the two given points."
msgstr ""
"U funkciji, možete uraditi mnogo kalkulacija koje su vam neophodne, "
"koristeći dva argumenta ako trebate. Trebali bi vratiti objekte koje želite "
"definisati. U našem slučaju, ovo je <classname>Tačka</classname>  objekat. "
"Isto tako, dva argumenta su <classname>Point</classname> objekti, i možemo "
"koristiti <function>Point.coordinate()</function> funkciju da definiramo "
"koordinate dvije date tačke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:807
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The calculation necessary in our example is very simple, we simply add the "
"two sets of coordinates, and divide the new set by two. We then construct a "
"new point using the result. The Python code needed is:"
msgstr ""
"Računica neophodna u našem primjeru je veoma jednostavna, dodamo dva skupa "
"koordinata, i podjelimo novi skup sa dva. Onda konstriramo novu tačku "
"koristeći rezultat. Potrebni Phython kod je:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"def calc( a, b ):\n"
"    m = ( a.coordinate() + b.coordinate() ) / 2;\n"
"    return Point( m )"
msgstr ""
"def calc( a, b ):\n"
"    m = ( a.coordinate() + b.coordinate() ) / 2;\n"
"    return Point( m )"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:816
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering the code"
msgstr "Ulaz u kod"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:822
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering the code for the midpoint in the Script Object wizard."
msgstr "Ulaz u kod za međutačku u Skripta Objekat Čarobnjaku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:827
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you now click the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button, the new object "
"will appear in the &kig; document. If you move one of the points, the newly "
"created point will move along with it. Much more powerful objects can be "
"built in this way: you are encouraged to try it out."
msgstr ""
"Ako sada kliknete  <guibutton>Završetak</guibutton>, novi objekat će se "
"pojaviti u &kig; dokumentu. Ako pomjerite jednu od tačaka, novokreirana "
"tačka će se kretati shodno s njom. Mnogo jači objekti se mogu izgraditi na "
"ovaj način: ohrabreni ste da probate ovaj način."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constructed a Script Object"
msgstr "Konstruisanje Skripta Objekta"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:841
#, no-c-format
msgid "The newly constructed Script Object."
msgstr "Novokonstruisana Skripta Objekta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:847
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All objects in &kig; can be used in the Python code. As we have seen above, "
"points are of the <classname>Point</classname> class, and you can use &eg; "
"the <function>Point.coordinate()</function> method. You can also return all "
"kinds of objects, not just a <classname>Point</classname>. Many more classes "
"and methods are available in the &kig; Python code, and a more complete "
"reference is provided <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig/manual/scripting-"
"api/index.html\">on the &kig; website</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Svi objekti u &kig; mogu biti korišteni u Phython kodu. Kao što svo vidjeli "
"iznad, tačke od <classname>Tačka</classname> klasu, i možete koristiti &eg;  "
"<function>Point.coordinate()</function>  metodu. Možete se vratiti na sve "
"vrste objekata, ne samo na <classname>Tačka</classname>. Mnoge druge klase i "
"metode su dostupne u &kig; Phython kodu, i mnogo kompletniji izvor je "
"omogućen <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig/manual/scripting-api/index.html"
"\">on the &kig; website</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:860
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; Features"
msgstr "&kig; Svojstva"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:864
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; is an open source application. This means that you are free to use and "
"modify it any way you like it. Distributing &kig; is subject to some "
"restrictions, basically that everyone should have the same rights to use "
"&kig;, including your modifications, as you and me."
msgstr ""
"&kig; je otvoreni izvor aplikacije. To znači da ste slobodni koristiti i "
"modifikovati ga na koji god način želite. Distribucija &kig; je subjekat "
"mnogim zabranama, da svako treba imati neka prava u korištenju &kig;, "
"uključujući modifikacije, kao ja i ti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Free software programs are developed in a very open spirit, and its "
"developers are usually very responsive to user feedback. Therefore, if you "
"have any questions, complaints, or whatever about &kig;, please let the "
"author know at <email>toscano.pino@tiscali.it</email>."
msgstr ""
"Besplatni softver programi su razvijeni u veoma otvorenom duhu, i njegovi "
"programeri su veoma aktivni u davanju povratnih informacija korisnicima. "
"Stoga, ako imate ikakva pitanja, žalbe ili bilo šta vezano za &kig; molim "
"vas da date autoru do znanja na e-mail <email>toscano.pino@tiscali.it</"
"email>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:880
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; is a KPart application, which means that you can embed it into other "
"&kde; software. If you open a <literal role=\"extension\">.kig</literal> "
"file in &konqueror;, it can be opened directly in the &konqueror; screen "
"without the need to start an external application."
msgstr ""
"&kig;  je KPart aplikacija, što znači da je možete ugraditi u drugi &kde; "
"softver. Ako otvorite  <literal role=\"extension\">.kig</literal> file in "
"&konqueror;, može biti direktno otvoren na &konqueror; ekranu bez potrebe za "
"započinjanjem nove eksterne aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:889
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Working with &kig; should be very straightforward. Constructing objects is "
"easy and interactive, with preliminary results being shown, &etc; Moving, "
"selecting and building all work as one would expect them to. Undo support "
"should also be very intuitive."
msgstr ""
"Rad sa &kig; može biti veoma iskren. Konstruisanje objekata je lagano i "
"interaktivno, sa preliminarnim rezultatima koji su pokazani, &etc; Kretnjom, "
"selekcijom i izgradnjom radeći kao jedno se od njih očekuje. Rasplesti "
"podršku bi isto trebalo biti intuitivno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:898
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; supports macros to be defined in a straightforward manner. These "
"objects are presented to the user like normal objects. They are saved on "
"exit and loaded on startup, so that they aren't lost on exit. You can manage "
"these objects in the <guilabel>Manage Types</guilabel> dialog (see <xref "
"linkend=\"working-with-types\"/>). You can export them to files, import them "
"from files, edit and delete them."
msgstr ""
"&kig;  podržava makroe da budu definisani na logičan način. Ovi objekti su "
"predstavljeni korisniku kao normalni objekti. Oni su sačuvani na završetku i "
"pokrenuti na početku, tako da ne budu izgubljeni na izlazu. Možete "
"upravljati ovim objektima u <guilabel>Upravljaj Tipovima</guilabel> dijalogu "
"(vidi<xref linkend=\"working-with-types\"/>). Možete ih premjestiti u "
"direktorije, urediti i izbrisati ih."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:910
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; saves its data in a clear &XML; format."
msgstr "&kig; sačuva svoje podatke u čistom &XML; formatu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:915
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; supports the construction of loci."
msgstr "&kig; podržava konstrukciju loci-a."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:920
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; allows you to export a &kig; file to some interesting formats, like "
"images, <application>XFig</application> and <application>LaTeX</application> "
"files, and <acronym>SVG</acronym> vectorial images. This is rather useful, "
"because not all programs support the &kig; file format yet."
msgstr ""
"&kig;  dozvoljava vam da izvedete &kig; folder uneki interesantniji format, "
"kao slika, <application>XFig</application> i <application>LaTeX</"
"application> foldere, i <acronym>SVG</acronym> vektorsku sliku. To je veoma "
"korisno, zato što svi programi ne podržavaju &kig; folder format još uvijek."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:929
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; has a very flexible transformation system."
msgstr "&kig; ima veoma fleksibilan transformaciski sistem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:934
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; aims to be compatible with its competitors. This is why it supports "
"the &kgeo; file format, the &kseg; file format and partially the &drgeo; and "
"&cabri; formats; moreover, support for other formats is planned."
msgstr ""
"&kig; namjerava da bude kompatibilan sa svojim konkurentima, Na taj način "
"podržava &kgeo; folder format, &kgeo; folder format i djelimično  &drgeo; i "
"&cabri; formate; Štaviše, podrška drugim formatima je planirana."

