#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:998 index.docbook:1014
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "Doprinijeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1000
#, no-c-format
msgid "Free Software"
msgstr "Slobodni Softver"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1001
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; is <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/philosophy/philosophy."
"html#AboutFreeSoftware\"> Free Software</ulink>. This means that its source "
"code is freely available on the Internet, and everyone can use it, read it, "
"modify it, and distribute it. I work on it as a hobby project, and I have "
"already learned a lot about programming, C++, &kde;/&Qt;, math, software "
"collaboration and open source projects in the process."
msgstr ""
"&kig; je <ulink url=\"http://www.gnu.org/philosophy/philosophy."
"html#AboutFreeSoftware\"> Slobodni Softver</ulink>. Ovo znači da je izvor "
"koda slobodno dostupan na internetu, i svi ga mogu koristiti, čitati, "
"modifikovati, i distribuirati. Ja radim na njemu kao na hobi projektu, i već "
"sam naučio mnogo o programiranju,  C++, &kde;/&Qt;, matematika, kolaboracija "
"softvera i otvoreni izvor projekta je u procesu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1015
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this chapter I want to point out to you (the user) the rights that "
"&kig;'s license gives you. As with all free software, you are allowed (and "
"encouraged) to fix problems you encounter while using it, to add features "
"you miss, to distribute your modified program, and to send these "
"modifications to me at <email>toscano.pino@tiscali.it</email>, so that I can "
"include them in the next version for others to enjoy. Please note I "
"personally have no financial interest in this project whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"U ovom poglavlju želim vam istaći (korisnicima) prava koja &kig;-ova dozvola "
"vama daje. Kako sa svim slobodnim softverima, dozvoljeno vam je (i "
"ohrabrujuće je) da rješavate probleme na koje naiđete dok ga koristite, kako "
"bi dodali značajke koje ste propustili, da distribuirate vaš modifikovani "
"program, i pošaljete te modifikacije meni na  <email>toscano.pino@tiscali."
"it</email>, kako bih ih uključio u sljedeću verziju za druge da uživaju. "
"Molim da napomenete kako nemam nikakav finansijski interesu ovom projektu."

