#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1037
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to contribute ?"
msgstr "Kako doprinijeti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1038
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any contributions are welcome. If you don't like the icons, or think that "
"the manual needs updating, or if you have this really cool macro that you "
"want to share with the world, do not hesitate to send it to me. Please note "
"that your contributions will be distributed under the terms of the &GNU; "
"<acronym>GPL</acronym>; you can find the terms of this license in the "
"<filename>COPYING</filename> file in the &kig; source tree, and in the <link "
"linkend=\"credits\">Credits and License</link> chapter in this manual."
msgstr ""
"Svaki doprinos je dobrodošao. Ako vam se ne sviđaju ikone, ili mislite da "
"priručnik treba ažuriranje, ili ako imate neki odličan makro koji želite "
"podijeliti sa svjetom,ne ustručavajte se da mi pošaljete. Molim vas da "
"shvatite da će vaši doprinosi biti pod uslovima &GNU; <acronym>GPL</"
"acronym>; možete naći uslove ove licence u <filename>COPYING</filename> "
"folder u  &kig; izvor, i u <link linkend=\"credits\">Credits and License</"
"link> poglavlju u ovom priručniku."
